{"model": "deepseek-flash", "thinking": "enabled", "prompt": "写一句关于秋天的诗。", "trial": 0, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "**一夜西风过，满城银杏黄。**\n\n若想更古典些，也可取：**霜天寥廓雁初飞，万木摇落一身秋。**"}], "usage": {"input_tokens": 167, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 128, "output_tokens": 289, "service_tier": "standard", "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 251}}}
{"model": "deepseek-flash", "thinking": "enabled", "prompt": "写一句关于秋天的诗。", "trial": 1, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "秋风起处叶纷飞，一径金黄染夕晖。"}], "usage": {"input_tokens": 167, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 128, "output_tokens": 33, "service_tier": "standard", "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 18}}}
{"model": "deepseek-flash", "thinking": "enabled", "prompt": "写一句关于秋天的诗。", "trial": 2, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "秋风起时，满山的叶子便替我写了一封金色的信。\n\n如果更喜欢古典一点的味道，也可以是这样的：\n\n> 一叶落知天下秋，半庭霜色半庭愁。\n\n或者更干净的一句：\n\n> 秋天是一封没寄出的信，被风一页页翻旧了。\n\n你想要哪种风格——古体还是现代？我可以再顺着写下去。"}], "usage": {"input_tokens": 167, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 128, "output_tokens": 109, "service_tier": "standard", "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 29}}}
{"model": "deepseek-flash", "thinking": "enabled", "prompt": "写一句关于秋天的诗。", "trial": 3, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "秋风起处叶初黄，一径寒声入夕阳。"}], "usage": {"input_tokens": 167, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 128, "output_tokens": 32, "service_tier": "standard", "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 17}}}
{"model": "deepseek-flash", "thinking": "enabled", "prompt": "写一句关于秋天的诗。", "trial": 4, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "秋风吹渭水，落叶满长安。"}], "usage": {"input_tokens": 167, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 128, "output_tokens": 28, "service_tier": "standard", "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 18}}}
{"model": "deepseek-flash", "thinking": "enabled", "prompt": "写一句关于秋天的诗。", "trial": 5, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "**一夜西风删旧叶，半山红影答残阳。**\n\n如果你更喜欢现代一点的味道，也可以是这样一句：\n\n*霜把最后一枚柿子点亮，秋天便在枝头有了灯。*"}], "usage": {"input_tokens": 167, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 128, "output_tokens": 232, "service_tier": "standard", "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 189}}}
{"model": "deepseek-flash", "thinking": "enabled", "prompt": "写一句关于秋天的诗。", "trial": 6, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "**一夜秋风染满山，半阶落叶半阶寒。**\n\n（一夜秋风把山染上颜色，台阶上落满黄叶，也落满了秋的寒意。）"}], "usage": {"input_tokens": 167, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 128, "output_tokens": 116, "service_tier": "standard", "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 78}}}
{"model": "deepseek-flash", "thinking": "enabled", "prompt": "写一句关于秋天的诗。", "trial": 7, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "**「一夜清霜落满庭，半窗疏雨送秋声。」**\n\n意思是：一夜清霜铺满庭院，窗外稀疏的雨声仿佛在送别秋天。"}], "usage": {"input_tokens": 167, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 128, "output_tokens": 175, "service_tier": "standard", "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 136}}}
{"model": "deepseek-flash", "thinking": "enabled", "prompt": "写一句关于秋天的诗。", "trial": 8, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "一夜秋风凋碧树，满阶黄叶是家书。\n\n（前句写景，后句把满阶落叶读作远方寄来的信——秋意最深处，总是思念。）"}], "usage": {"input_tokens": 167, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 128, "output_tokens": 143, "service_tier": "standard", "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 101}}}
{"model": "deepseek-flash", "thinking": "enabled", "prompt": "写一句关于秋天的诗。", "trial": 9, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "**一夜秋风穿巷过，满城银杏尽镀金。**\n\n（可再续两句凑成小诗：**行人莫叹枝将空，落处犹铺万点金。**）"}], "usage": {"input_tokens": 167, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 128, "output_tokens": 150, "service_tier": "standard", "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 107}}}
{"model": "deepseek-flash", "thinking": "enabled", "prompt": "写一句关于秋天的诗。", "trial": 10, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "**「霜落千林瘦，风回一叶秋。」**\n\n这一句写的是深秋景象：寒霜过后，林木显得清瘦疏朗，一阵风吹过，一片落叶便带来了秋天的消息。\n\n如果你想换个风格，也可以选：\n\n- 婉约一点：「一庭秋色无人管，只有黄花对客开。」\n- 疏朗一点：「山明水净夜来霜，数树深红出浅黄。」\n- 现代一点：「秋天是一封没有署名的信，风把它读给我们听。」\n\n需要我按某个主题（思乡、离别、丰收、清冷）再写一句吗？"}], "usage": {"input_tokens": 167, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 128, "output_tokens": 175, "service_tier": "standard", "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 41}}}
{"model": "deepseek-flash", "thinking": "enabled", "prompt": "写一句关于秋天的诗。", "trial": 11, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "**「霜落千林瘦，风来一叶秋。」**\n\n（若要更现代的写法，也可：*秋天是从第一片叶子松手开始的。*）"}], "usage": {"input_tokens": 167, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 128, "output_tokens": 179, "service_tier": "standard", "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 143}}}
